      <span class="price">₱190 / Session</span>
      <h3>Classic Manicure (Reg. Polish)</h3>
      <p>A refreshing cleanse that revives your skin with essential care—perfect for a quick glow-up and maintenance.</p>
      <a href="/Home/Booking?service=Manicure%20(Regular%20Polish)&id=152&price=190&category=Nail%20Care
        &img=basic-facial.jpg
        &desc=Manicure%20with%20Regular%20Polish" class="book-btn">BOOK NOW</a>
    </div>

        <div class="facial-card">
      <img src="~/LerayImages/acne-facial.jpg" alt="Classic Pedicure" class="NailCare-img">
