      <h3>Classic Pedicure (Reg. Polish)</h3>
      <p>Targets breakouts and clears impurities with deep cleansing and anti-inflammatory treatments for calmer skin.</p>
      <a href="/Home/Booking?service=Pedicure%20(Regular%20Polish)&id=153&price=200&category=Nail%20Care
