      <h3>Foot Spa with Pedicure</h3>
      <p>A luxurious multi-step facial combining premium techniques for ultimate rejuvenation.</p>
     
   <a href="/Home/Booking?service=Foot%20Spa%20with%20Pedicure&id=181&price=500&category=Spa%20Services
        &img=signature-facial.jpg
        &desc=Foot%20Spa%20with%20Pedicure" class="book-btn">BOOK NOW</a>
    </div>

