      <p>An exfoliating diamond tip technology to smooth skin and enhance radiance.</p>
      <a href="/Home/Booking?service=SoftGel/Polygel/Builder%20Extensions&id=158&price=999&category=Nail%20Extensions
        &img=diamond-facial.jpg
        &desc=SoftGel/Polygel/Builder%20Extensions" class="book-btn">BOOK NOW</a>
    </div>

        <div class="facial-card">
