      <p>Infuses hydration while cleansing dull or sensitive skin in need of renewal.</p>
      <a href="/Home/Booking?service=Manicure%20(Gel%20Polish)&id=155&price=450&category=Nail%20Care
        &img=hydra-facial.jpg
        &desc=Manicure%20with%20Gel%20Polish" class="book-btn">BOOK NOW</a>
    </div>

        <div class="facial-card">
