      <p>A quick and effective injectable that targets stubborn pimples for fast, visible results.</p>
      <a href="/Home/Booking?service=Nail%20Art%20Designs&id=163&price=50&category=Nail%20Extensions
        &img=acne-shot.jpg
        &desc=Nail%20Art%20Designs%20(Per%20Nail)" class="book-btn">BOOK NOW</a>
    </div>

      </div>
